{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/31/3714825/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライヴリハの様子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/31/3714825/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きつかったけど、みんなで乗り越えたね！＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番、ステージ裏のモニター前で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/31/3714825/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/31/3714825/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の光が本当に美しくて、\nすごく感動しました。\n絶対この景色、忘れることはないんだろう、忘れちゃいけないんだろうって\nいっぱい目に焼き付けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、もっともっと\nこの美しい光が増えていくように\n頑張りたいです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このライヴでまた沢山のことを学んで、\nいろんなことがあったけど、\n言いたいことは、ただ一言です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に、みなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんな大好き！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2012/12/31/3714825/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そして、\n今日は今年最後の日ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとって、素敵な\n一日になりますようにっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/i